Today is Friday evening.
At the end of the week, Suresh calls us all.
Rohan, Priya, Vikram, and I go there.
We all sit down.
Suresh says, "We have done a lot of work this week."
He asks, "Maya, have you finished your work?"
I say, "Yes, I have written my code."
"I have finished that task."
Then Vikram says, "I have tested that code."
He is a good tester.
Priya says, "I have also finished my design work."
She is a skilled designer.
Suresh is satisfied.
He says, "Excellent, we have all worked well together."
The meeting ends.
I go to my place.
I put my laptop in the bag.
Today I am very happy.
I feel that I am a real colleague here.
